{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 14:40:53", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-cae06703-e82a-4c69-8816-f295ad31b8ab', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Self-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for TDD Coordinator\\n\\n**Recommendation:** Model optimization for TDD Coordinator\\n**Description:** Consider using claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 instead of claude-3-5-haiku-20241022. Expected improvement: +50.0% success rate\\n\\n**Required Change:**\\nUpdate the agent definition file for TDD Coordinator to use the \'sonnet\' model.\\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent\'s markdown file.\\n\\nAfter making the change:\\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\\n3. Report the changes made",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01STsEFxW5frdUBfEwADTJhJ', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/agents/tdd_coordinator.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01STsEFxW5frdUBfEwADTJhJ', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "File not found: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/agents/tdd_coordinator.md"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BNQc5to71BZ9Bdx8EkJyv4', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/