**Compatibility**: Consistent rendering across browsers\\n4. **Performance**: No measurable impact on load times\\n\\n### Risk Mitigation\\n- **Backup Strategy**: Git commits before each major change\\n- **Rollback Plan**: Immediate revert capability documented\\n- **Progressive Testing**: Each task validates before proceeding\\n- **Multiple Browsers**: Cross-platform testing throughout\\n\\n## Estimated Timeline\\n- **Setup and Analysis**: 1 hour (Tasks 1-2)\\n- **Implementation**: 30 minutes (Task 3)\\n- **Testing**: 2-3 hours (Tasks 4-8)\\n- **Documentation**: 30 minutes (Task 9)\\n- **Total**: 4-5 hours for complete implementation\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n1. Background color visibly changed to dark green\\n2. All accessibility standards maintained\\n3. Zero functional regressions\\n4. Consistent cross-browser rendering\\n5. No performance degradation"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TMVwhQvyr1n1m8NPWJEHtU', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Change web UI background color from dark blue (#1a1d29) to dark green (#1a291d) while maintaining accessibility and functionality', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src', 'test_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/tests', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01TMVwhQvyr1n1m8NPWJEHtU', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Ek7dbNPExyMi2Ctsqx3vVy', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Complete milestone 1: Web UI background color change from dark blue to dark green'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_res