oss different browsers\n4. Documentation of color changes made\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ Background color changed from #1a1d29 (dark blue) to appropriate dark green\n- ✅ All text remains readable with proper contrast ratios\n- ✅ No visual artifacts or broken layouts\n- ✅ Application functions identically to before\n- ✅ Changes committed to version control\n\n### Dependencies\n- Access to CSS files\n- Ability to test in browser\n- Color accessibility validation\n\n### Technical Details\n- Primary target: `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/index.css`\n- Proposed color: #1a291d (dark green equivalent)\n- Maintain Bootstrap compatibility\n- Preserve existing class structure\n\n### Risk Assessment\n**Low Risk Project**\n- Single file change\n- Simple color substitution\n- No functional modifications\n- Easy to revert if issues\n\n### Definition of Done\n- Background displays in dark green\n- All UI elements visible and functional\n- Code committed with descriptive message\n- Quick visual test completed'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01BfqymvaguoeJJvivyZBY5A', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_143828.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_143828.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01WwyNg9RemUi8FdAMF3gUAh', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Web 