formance degradation in agent execution\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 7: Documentation and Code Comments\\n- **Description**: Update documentation for new components and changes\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Document CostCalculator usage and pricing model\\n  - Comment complex logic in ActivityTracker\\n  - Update README/architecture docs\\n  - Include examples of new metric tracking\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Simple"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011dTmC1vF7DWNbFCEMbeKqw', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement', 'description': 'Backend implementation of agent cost tracking infrastructure with full TDD approach'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011dTmC1vF7DWNbFCEMbeKqw', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "e92a49f8", "message": "Created project: Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement", "summary": {"project_id": "e92a49f8", "project_name": "Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement", "description": "Backend implementation of agent cost tracking infrastructure with full TDD approach", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:42:26.575853", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T14:42:26.575853", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T14:42:26.575853", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Es8p2RBRVMUwatunrmWsps', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Implement backend infrastructure for agent cost tracking, focusing on TDD methodolo