{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 14:45:49", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-92224967-4a61-45d4-89f7-019ef9a92ca6', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent-cost-tracking-enhancement/backend_tasks_milestone1.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement",\n  "project_id": "e462580b",\n  "context": "Implement backend tasks for agent cost tracking with full TDD approach",\n  "task_id": "36d89691"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MSPSem9rcboSd3VPUarjms', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent-cost-tracking-enhancement/backend_tasks_milestone1.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MSPSem9rcboSd3VPUarjms', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Backend Tasks - Milestone 1: Backend Tracking Infrastructure\\n\\n## Task 1: Implement CostCalculator Module\\n- **Description**: Create `cost_calculator.py` to calculate token-based cost estimates\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Supports cost calculation for Claude models (Opus, Sonnet, Haiku)\\n  - Handles input and output token pricing\\n  - Provides fallback estimation method\\n- **Dependencies**: None\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n\\n## Task 2: Extend ActivityTracker Data Structures\\n- **Description**: Update activity_tracker.py to capture new agent