g",\n      "duration": "0.5 weeks",\n      "objective": "Analyze comparative results and generate comprehensive performance report",\n      "status": "planned"\n    }\n  ],\n  "deliverables": [\n    "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md",\n    "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md",\n    "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md",\n    "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md"\n  ],\n  "message": "Successfully completed Milestone 1 planning and initiated implementation. System Architect designed comprehensive Test-Driven Experimentation Architecture using Node.js/TypeScript. Backend and Test Coordinators provided detailed task breakdowns with 11 backend tasks and 15 test tasks. TDD Coordinator was spawned for implementation of the test framework and haiku baseline collection phase.",\n  "self_analysis": "I successfully executed the complete planning workflow from requirements analysis through architecture design and task breakdown coordination. The sequential spawning of System Architect, Backend Coordinator, and Test Coordinator produced comprehensive planning artifacts. However, I need to verify the TDD Coordinator implementation status since the spawn appeared successful but no obvious code artifacts were created in the expected backend directory.",\n  "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent Test-Driven Experimentation Architecture design with thoughtful technology choices and comprehensive component breakdown. Backend and Test Coordinators provided detailed, well-structured task breakdowns with clear dependencies and acceptance criteria. TDD Coordinator spawn was successful but implementation status unclear - may need follow-up to verify actual code generation occurred in the designated output