Test API response formatting\\n  - Achieve > 90% code coverage\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2, Task 3, Task 4\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 6: Performance and Error Handling Validation\\n- **Description**: Validate performance impact and error handling for new metrics tracking\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Verify metric calculation overhead is < 5ms\\n  - Handle scenarios with missing token usage\\n  - Gracefully manage unknown models\\n  - No performance degradation in agent execution\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 7: Documentation and Code Comments\\n- **Description**: Update documentation for new components and changes\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Document CostCalculator usage and pricing model\\n  - Comment complex logic in ActivityTracker\\n  - Update README/architecture docs\\n  - Include examples of new metric tracking\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Simple"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01H9Z6wdWuZsQqLdiC15KRui', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement', 'description': 'Backend infrastructure for tracking agent execution metrics, including cost calculation, activity tracking, and performance measurement'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01H9Z6wdWuZsQqLdiC15KRui', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "85a0322d", "message": "Created project: Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement", "summary": {"project_id": "85a0322d", "project_name": "Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement", "description": "Backend infrastructure for tracking agent execution metrics, including cost calculation, activity tracking, and performance measurement", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:41:38.742873", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:41:38.742873", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "complete