d fields for `started_at`, `completed_at`, `duration_ms`\\n  - Add fields for `model_used`, `cost_estimate`\\n  - Add `token_usage` sub-structure\\n  - Ensure backward compatibility\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1 (CostCalculator)\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n\\n## Task 3: Modify AgentRuntime for Metric Tracking\\n- **Description**: Update AgentRuntime to capture and calculate execution metrics\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Record start time on initialization\\n  - Extract token usage from Claude API responses\\n  - Calculate execution duration\\n  - Use CostCalculator to estimate execution cost\\n  - Pass metrics to activity tracker\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 4: Update API Endpoint Responses\\n- **Description**: Modify API responses to include new agent execution metrics\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Add new fields to agent state responses\\n  - Ensure new fields are optional (backward compatibility)\\n  - Format timestamps in ISO format\\n  - Include duration, cost estimate, and model information\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 2, Task 3\\n- **Complexity**: Simple\\n\\n## Task 5: Implement Unit Tests for New Components\\n- **Description**: Create comprehensive unit tests for new and modified components\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Test CostCalculator with various models and token scenarios\\n  - Test ActivityTracker data structure updates\\n  - Test AgentRuntime metric calculation\\n  - Test API response formatting\\n  - Achieve > 90% code coverage\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2, Task 3, Task 4\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 6: Performance and Error Handling Validation\\n- **Description**: Validate performance impact and error handling for new metrics tracking\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Verify metric calculation overhead is < 5ms\\n  - Handle scenarios with missing token usage\\n  - Gracefully manage unknown models\\n  - No performance degradation in agent execution\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 7: Documentation and Code Comments\\n- **Description**: Update documentation for new components and changes\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Document CostCalculator usage and pricing model\\n  - Comment complex logic in ActivityTracker\\n  - Update README/architecture docs\\n  - Include examples of new metric tracking\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Simple"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01FUmqpcwcggyTFTU4xp6huU', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True, 'history_count': 5}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01FUmqpcwcggyTFTU4xp6huU', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "feature/tdd-model-validation-m1", "changes": {"staged": [], "unstaged": [], "untracked": ["src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/package.json", "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/tsconfig.json"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "49958f620e0031819a42deeb66f74453d3342f9c", "message": "Modify AgentRuntime to capture and calculate detailed execution metrics", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "8 hours ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "49958f620e0031819a42deeb66f74453d3342f9c", "message": "Modify AgentRuntime to capture and calculate detailed execution metrics", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "8 hours ago"}, {"hash": "6c47863ed0c212dc45b590c6d5768369c5d954c0", "message": "Extend ActivityTracker Data Structures for detailed agent execution metrics", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "8 hours ago"}, {"hash": "711af7085f2e4641f64a3795771282b44717d450", "message": "Start implementation of CostCalculator Module for agent cost tracking", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "8 hours ago"}, {"hash": "85218a16f4b17f1e6a3bf76ee9e2839f1db1d1ec", "message": "Complete milestone 1: Web UI background color change from dark blue to dark green", "author": "Matt Billock", "wh