ptance Criteria\\n- \\u2713 New tasks spawn with unique, consistent family names\\n- \\u2713 Child agents automatically inherit family name\\n- \\u2713 Family names visible in all agent displays\\n- \\u2713 API supports family information retrieval\\n- \\u2713 Family-level achievement tracking implemented\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Maintain existing agent spawning mechanisms\\n- Minimal performance overhead for name generation\\n- Backwards compatibility with existing systems\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Detailed family history tracking\\n- Complex genealogy systems\\n- Permanent family assignments across multiple projects\\n\\n## Potential Family Achievement Types\\n1. Collective Task Completion\\n2. Efficiency Metrics\\n3. Innovation Score\\n4. Collaborative Problem Solving\\n\\n## Notes\\n- Use whimsical, memorable naming strategies\\n- Ensure randomness prevents predictable family names\\n- Design for extensibility of family concept"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01T79grnPFq1Jdvaq5orrN8M', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '9061d08f', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Requirements analysis complete. Project involves implementing family-based naming system for agents with UI enhancements and achievement tracking. Key components: name generation, inheritance, UI updates, and family achievements.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01T79grnPFq1Jdvaq5orrN8M', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018sizuYG3K6Dcq9HcYziYUJ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': '9061d08f', 'description': 'Implement Agent Families feature following TDD methodology: family name generation, inheritance, UI updates, and achievement tracking', 'assigned_to': 'development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result